-> [[docs:guide-user:installation:generic.flashing|Install OpenWrt (generic explanation)]]
  - Serve the initramfs.img using a TFTP server with address 10.10.10.3.
  - Interrupt the uboot startup process via UART.
  - Select "System Load Linux to SDRAM via TFTP" item.
  - (important) Back up firmware(mtd7) partitions with: ''dd if=/dev/mtd7 of=/tmp/firmware.bin'' and then download the firmware.bin image via SCP.
  - Flash the OpenWrt sysupgrade firmware.

