==== Opening the case ====

**Note:** This will void your warranty!

Remove the four bottom screws, they're hidden under the rubber feet.

The lid is also held in place by additional plastic latches, three on the left and on the right, 
if you have side of the router, with the top button, closest to you. 

The easiest way to remove the lid, is by inserting a small screwdriver in each of the
four holes, where the screws were, and apply some pressure, making the lid pop off.   

:!: The antenna wires may align over the screw holes inside the case as the it's separated, 
be careful not to damage any such wires when applying pressure with the screwdriver.

