==== Serial ====
-> [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial]] general information about the serial port, serial port cable, etc.

Serial port is located on the bottom side of the PCB (unless you want to remove the top side heat sink).

Mark (so you know which one's which) and disconnect the four uFL antenna connectors, remove the screws
holding the PCB in place, and flip it over.

**Don't connect the 3.3v pin!**

{{media:reyee:reyee_rg-e5_pcb_back.jpg?600|}}

